{
	"name": "Innate Arcanist",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Just because you were born with your magic is no reason to rest on your laurels when it comes to mastering it. You have begun to experiment with your power in earnest, eager to see what you can actually do. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Wisdom, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with the Arcana skill or an expertise die if you are already proficient. You can always use Charisma when making Arcana skill checks.</p></li><li><p>You learn the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.kvl1y5un24o6tb8r]{Dynamism} cantrip or another sorcerer cantrip if you already know it.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.q162ah61o4pgc1dd]{Minor Metamagic} option. It does not count against your Minor Metamagic options known.</p></li></ul>",
